OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPolice defend response to Port of
OL,4,ADover protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have defended their handling of
OL,7,Fa protest involving a group of masked
OL,8,Fmen that brought the Port of Dover to a
OL,9,Fstandstill for several hours on
OL,10,FSaturday.
OL,12,FAfter hundreds of protesters dressed in
OL,13,Fblack blocked roads and chanted 'stop
OL,14,Fthe boats', local MP Mike Tapp said
OL,15,Fquestions needed to be asked why it
OL,16,Fappeared the police "didn't know" about
OL,17,Fthe demonstration beforehand.
OL,19,FKent Police Assistant Chief Constable
OL,20,FNigel Brookes said the force would
OL,21,F"examine the intelligence process".
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
