OL,3,GNEWSAPolice defend response to Port of
OL,4,ADover protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe added: "It is important to note that
OL,7,Fwe do not as a matter of course monitor
OL,8,Fpeaceful protestors, and their
OL,9,Fpolitical viewpoints are not taken into
OL,10,Fconsideration."
